        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "Add package changelog previews for plugin publishing",
        "body": "Closes #1288.\n\nAdds README-based package changelog previews for plugin release publishes and guards the async preview path so stale generated text cannot overwrite user edits. Package changelog preview now verifies the caller can publish/manage the existing package before reading previous release storage; direct owners, publisher org members, moderators, and admins are allowed, while unrelated signed-in users are denied before storage is read.\n\nBehavior proof:\n```text\nconvex/packages.public.test.ts convex/lib/changelog.test.ts src/__tests__/plugins-publish-route.test.tsx\nTest Files  3 passed (3)\nTests  316 passed (316)\n```\n\nAdditional gates: `bun run ci:static`, `VITE_CONVEX_URL=https://example.invalid bun run ci:types-build`, and `git diff --check` passed. `bunx convex codegen` could not run in this worktree because `CONVEX_DEPLOYMENT` is not configured. Real browser proof was requested from Mantis because this worktree has no usable local Convex `.env.local`/`.convex` setup.",
